                    {
                        "form_id": "85bf3ad6-dba6-4c5e-87ee-95a7d390a023",
                        "entry_id": "0c5200f9-84ce-393b-8274-af2b0a14b0c3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "бакале́ях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e267a8e2-fbf4-33da-a83b-513dc9cefd4b",
                        "entry_id": "0c5200f9-84ce-393b-8274-af2b0a14b0c3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "собир. сухие продовольственные товары длительного хранения: чай, сахар, кофе, крупа, мука, пряности и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f39b6a09-e894-495c-975f-b91a1f5b2263",
                                "sense_id": "e267a8e2-fbf4-33da-a83b-513dc9cefd4b",
                                "text": "Поднялся хлебец в цене на пятачок ― красный товар у купцов встал, еще на пятачок ― бакалея разная остановилась, а еще на пятачок ― и всё остальное се́ло."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "697ade05-b271-4e3a-b73c-e94c86bd4c9b",
                                "sense_id": "e267a8e2-fbf4-33da-a83b-513dc9cefd4b",
                                "text": "Для обихода на наличные деньги приобреталась только бакалея и материал для одежды, и всё «покупное» расходовалось до крайности расчетливо и даже скупо."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d520ab81-1e30-4054-b26d-8686f2861e2b",
                                "sense_id": "e267a8e2-fbf4-33da-a83b-513dc9cefd4b",
                                "text": "Нужно, однако ж, сказать, что ежели и есть налицо бакалейщики, то Домнушка не всю привезённую ими бакалею ставит на стол, а половину откладывает."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8de5c4fb-8307-3236-9c48-b21e41b24eba",
                        "entry_id": "0c5200f9-84ce-393b-8274-af2b0a14b0c3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. магазин или отдел в продовольственном магазине, торгующий такими товарами"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16f00377-f17c-453d-8647-4ec8b96d4867",
                                "sense_id": "8de5c4fb-8307-3236-9c48-b21e41b24eba",
                                "text": "Стоило Воскобоеву присесть на край подоконника, взглянуть в окно и поднести к папиросе зажжённую спичку ― Елизавета была тут как тут и, подняв мужа, как охотник куропатку, гнала его в бакалею за желатином и корицей…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "94b38e36-a6e2-462d-a8e1-696897043149",
                                "sense_id": "8de5c4fb-8307-3236-9c48-b21e41b24eba",
                                "text": "Она устроилась в магазин, в бакалею, здесь же, в посёлке, ― постоянная продавщица ушла в декрет."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1242abcf-d27d-4baf-9e4f-cbf629860d62",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c5200f9-84ce-393b-8274-af2b0a14b0c3",
                        "target_lang_word": "grocery",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "grocery",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "065c4ee6-58e4-3069-9d4e-bc30a0e76c40",
                                        "entry_id": "490cbb9b-50df-3262-b7d7-e7f7bc21ce0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Retail foodstuffs and other household supplies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "083ed479-862e-4fbe-9a7f-436b97386337",
                                                "sense_id": "065c4ee6-58e4-3069-9d4e-bc30a0e76c40",
                                                "text": "1776: Adam Smith, The Wealth of Nations\nWhere ten thousand pounds can be employed in the grocery trade, the wages of the grocer's labour make but a very trifling addition..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91aafea6-4751-3bf9-9404-ec53a0e9f09e",
                                        "entry_id": "490cbb9b-50df-3262-b7d7-e7f7bc21ce0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shop or store that sells groceries; a grocery store."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49a5db64-9e34-46d0-82ab-00f64cad4f03",
                                                "sense_id": "91aafea6-4751-3bf9-9404-ec53a0e9f09e",
                                                "text": "1854: Henry David Thoreau, Walden\nI observed that the vitals of the village were the grocery, the bar-room, the post-office, and the bank..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "grocery",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45543a88-755d-3855-b20e-fe4105425f4b",
                                        "entry_id": "20824f32-f0a9-334e-a3b0-949c8143795f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To go grocery shopping."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "152f8d34-21c9-462d-8b98-f532825a4bb2",
                                                "sense_id": "45543a88-755d-3855-b20e-fe4105425f4b",
                                                "text": "We shopped and groceried on a cash basis, determined on that from the start."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02bb4d89-c5cd-41ff-bf49-ec1a639d33a9",
                                                "sense_id": "45543a88-755d-3855-b20e-fe4105425f4b",
                                                "text": "The thought of grocerying so casually at Seessel's evokes a giggle from Shirley"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a518bf3-89b4-4265-b435-78a796fd6d65",
                                                "sense_id": "45543a88-755d-3855-b20e-fe4105425f4b",
                                                "text": "I was dependent upon others for grocerying and getting to doctor appointments."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b61ee826-791c-4cb1-918f-d17b5a50f493",
                                                "sense_id": "45543a88-755d-3855-b20e-fe4105425f4b",
                                                "text": "Sample usage: \"If you're going grocerying, pick up some GMO — you know, Goat's Milk, Organic. But it has to be non-GMO GMO.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68825f90-3c13-313b-a52f-54f8aa934f23",
                                        "entry_id": "20824f32-f0a9-334e-a3b0-949c8143795f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To furnish with groceries."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a595e622-c917-4626-9618-d88057c1155c",
                                                "sense_id": "68825f90-3c13-313b-a52f-54f8aa934f23",
                                                "text": "Fifty-eight years of grocerying hotels, restaurants and institutions that feed many people"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07571bf7-0b24-48be-a436-8738774c2e8c",
                                                "sense_id": "68825f90-3c13-313b-a52f-54f8aa934f23",
                                                "text": "What freedom to be iced, fueled, and groceried for two weeks and running toward a reef you truly love"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5927197-2fde-47b8-b2b0-a73f15a36812",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c5200f9-84ce-393b-8274-af2b0a14b0c3",
                        "target_lang_word": "groceries",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "groceries",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71cc680f-f027-384d-b810-d29a38c9dc7b",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9012e3-6ae9-34ea-84f8-96a5a90b618c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Retail foodstuffs and other household supplies; the commodities sold by a grocer or in a grocery store."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "606707d3-40b0-448a-8201-58ce01552883",
                                                "sense_id": "71cc680f-f027-384d-b810-d29a38c9dc7b",
                                                "text": "She carried a sack of groceries in from her car and placed it on the kitchen table."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afacf261-b4ec-474f-a656-991aac1561be",
                                                "sense_id": "71cc680f-f027-384d-b810-d29a38c9dc7b",
                                                "text": "Did not cotton spin itself, beef grow, and groceries and spiceries come in from the East and the West, quite comfortably by the side of shams?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "groceries",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8ae6c00-2c21-3498-add4-f280c2689b63",
                                        "entry_id": "b7a1f4b4-dcd8-3ccd-a6ce-e9af881fc59d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "plural of grocery (store)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cf2985a-522d-44e3-b544-00a36ea2bbea",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ae6c00-2c21-3498-add4-f280c2689b63",
                                                "text": "There were two competing groceries in the neighborhood, but neither of them had tasty food."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
